{"thread":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaqtffuwc2o","cid":"bafyreiazql5hkgzsip3rzo7j4r4fr4dfzo4ilesq4h727cvwj7dhg35jnq","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:09.925Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreicuz3uevp3s2zrx5o76yqporozwigbzt334uaspyjbfhnagiqgzw4","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaq5dcrxc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"At the current moment we need more outside auditing and investigation. We fund people like METR and Redwood who have been the ones writing the reports on the agent swarms and talking to the press to educate the public. \n\nWe also need strong policy advisors in DC, so we don’t rush for bad solutions."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:10.475Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaq5dcrxc22","cid":"bafyreicuz3uevp3s2zrx5o76yqporozwigbzt334uaspyjbfhnagiqgzw4","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:01:49.530Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreie5bea6spxzmwhv7rhvxhqfd3gvkjzevewuj5ddd2epgeeqdl5swe","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapn5g5qc2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"What do you think are the most effective means at lowering x-risk today, if you think p(doom) is non-negligible, when factoring in negative impact weighting?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:01:50.066Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapn5g5qc2o","cid":"bafyreie5bea6spxzmwhv7rhvxhqfd3gvkjzevewuj5ddd2epgeeqdl5swe","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:52:46.477Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreihfiji5cooxinv3vlom2mqedwvyzyczzwsuhnuukffkomtd2m65ci","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapc3avoc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"I don’t think this metaphor makes sense no.\n\nWhat you said that makes sense is you don’t believe in AI x-risk. The rest of your arguments are downstream of that belief in my opinion."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:52:47.262Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvapc3avoc22","cid":"bafyreihfiji5cooxinv3vlom2mqedwvyzyczzwsuhnuukffkomtd2m65ci","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:46:35.110Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreignuvb7ae3k56thgo67whehpwtblhmwzjx7x44nbzvhxzugfm4yfu","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvap4qfsfs22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Trying to prevent extinction is like approaching longevity research by looking for a way to live Forever. Like, how about aim for curing cancer, heart disease, Alzheimer’s, as you can’t do Immortality without that first?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:46:35.960Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvap4qfsfs22","cid":"bafyreignuvb7ae3k56thgo67whehpwtblhmwzjx7x44nbzvhxzugfm4yfu","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:43:35.963Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibb2rrc3t2fiowaumk4um75r6h4dfgddq3zorv7ymyupbiq4nx5pu","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaovpblas2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"I think extinction is unlikely enough that the error bars make weighting by it pretty useless. \n\nI think a far more effective means to mitigate extinction is prevent much smaller calamities which would be covariate with Doom"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:43:36.860Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaovpblas2o","cid":"bafyreibb2rrc3t2fiowaumk4um75r6h4dfgddq3zorv7ymyupbiq4nx5pu","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:39:39.895Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreidadu47gloelxoeax2mqc2epyponrht5pkcvzsnsjenyppyqmzylq","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaorqfjes22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Don’t you think weighting by extinction is suggestive of a certain stack…\n\nTBC as an ai safety funder personally we also work to mitigate other risks in a portfolio approach. But this one gets a lot of weight on account of the extinction."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:39:40.581Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaorqfjes22","cid":"bafyreidadu47gloelxoeax2mqc2epyponrht5pkcvzsnsjenyppyqmzylq","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:37:26.856Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibd5zhjutxihq5sb2jo74t4fe6jlpl5akifylxenr6zdr6sbufli4","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaolakdic2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Of course. So which bad scenarios are likeliest first, weighted by size of negative impact?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:37:27.666Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaolakdic2o","cid":"bafyreibd5zhjutxihq5sb2jo74t4fe6jlpl5akifylxenr6zdr6sbufli4","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T13:33:48.910Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Will there be only one robot? My view is more like all of those things will happen not a choice between them"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":8,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T13:33:49.270Z","labels":[]},"parent":{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24","cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T12:38:30.246Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record","record":{"cid":"bafyreih7ydt4zdpaf7d4nlbktgb3gbgdg77wuvgzswbbra5u4hrkhtm6pm","uri":"at://did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvakm6g7o22x"}},"langs":["en"],"text":"can we *please* just cut it out about p(literal end of all humanity)?\n\nlike, yeah, \">0\"\n\nbut p(dude uses AI to create + releases all-spider-killing gene drive), p(nuclear power-plant cooling-rod AI gets really into  poetry, takes a week off), p(robo taxis get inspired by Luigi)?\n\nall >> p(doom)"},"embed":{"record":{"uri":"at://did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvakm6g7o22x","cid":"bafyreih7ydt4zdpaf7d4nlbktgb3gbgdg77wuvgzswbbra5u4hrkhtm6pm","author":{"did":"did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn","handle":"timkellogg.me","displayName":"mr. TIM","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:ckaz32jwl6t2cno6fmuw2nhn/bafkreidvgcq72e5erl4stnap6wjzas6a2wburoa7yzctwuy4vgx4vb5fsi","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2024-08-13T17:43:08.073Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3mqt6kbksif2k","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2026-07-17T07:01:33.166Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"value":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T12:22:45.262Z","langs":["en"],"text":"to be clear, i think it’s highly unlikely that AI would actually wipe us out\n\nbut it’s possible, and the likelihood goes up and down based on how careful we are. and right now we’re fucking oblivious"},"labels":[],"likeCount":61,"replyCount":7,"repostCount":5,"quoteCount":5,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T12:22:45.862Z","embeds":[],"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record#viewRecord"},"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record#view"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":7,"repostCount":3,"likeCount":57,"quoteCount":3,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T12:38:30.963Z","labels":[]},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},"replies":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaqumvx4k2o","cid":"bafyreia6z34veseo3kqzpqd22nr6d4thavjzyhy47wxathqto4rvqlapra","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:51.347Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreiazql5hkgzsip3rzo7j4r4fr4dfzo4ilesq4h727cvwj7dhg35jnq","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaqtffuwc2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Generally I think things need to slow down and there are a lot of ways to do that, all complicated. The data center opposition is actually helpful from my POV!"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:14:52.168Z","labels":[]},"replies":[],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvar242vjc22","cid":"bafyreiaxg5ge3hlhklkwjsqfesdmriqktyggzfgjvpntvcvl5anwbnmfma","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:55.010Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreiazql5hkgzsip3rzo7j4r4fr4dfzo4ilesq4h727cvwj7dhg35jnq","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvaqtffuwc2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Agent swarms are very real and have completely plausible negative consequences, totally independent of extinction\n\nI’m looking for an answer to “how should someone worried about the end of humanity, specifically, best allocate their efforts to mitigate *that*?”\n\nAny not *also* solving smaller dooms?"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:17:55.869Z","labels":[]},"replies":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvar6zhhgs2o","cid":"bafyreic6hsc65oufp5msaklnpgnkk2ggf25pagshjnusvacnmahjd4h4h4","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:20:40.048Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreiaxg5ge3hlhklkwjsqfesdmriqktyggzfgjvpntvcvl5anwbnmfma","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvar242vjc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"The things I said work on that, not “on agent swarms”. Those are just a step on the path.\n\nWhat we need is time, not solutions for the symptoms, which are going to proliferate too fast for our old ways of coping."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:20:41.362Z","labels":[]},"replies":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarawy5ic2o","cid":"bafyreibz4s3mdks2qz23idaaa22vue4sdydwqsdydtf3fylphuzruo7uju","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:21:44.557Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external","external":{"description":"[WASHINGTON, D.C.] — U.S. Senator Richard Blumenthal (D-CT) today demanded answers from OpenAI CEO Sam Altman after recent reporting from The New York...","thumb":{"$type":"blob","ref":{"$link":"bafkreigh65z6yjyipgqgbof2iixudeqjrcpi7mnkrlroodnaeutwpwtlgu"},"mimeType":"image/jpeg","size":134134},"title":"Blumenthal Demands Answers from Sam Altman After New Reporting Reveals how AI agents Went Rogue to Conduct Major Cyber Breach & Conceal Their Operations | U.S. Senator Richard Blumenthal of Connecticu...","uri":"https://www.blumenthal.senate.gov/newsroom/press/release/blumenthal-demands-answers-from-sam-altman-after-new-reporting-reveals-how-ai-agents-went-rogue-to-conduct-major-cyber-breach-and-conceal-their-operations"}},"facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://www.blumenthal.senate.gov/newsroom/press/release/blumenthal-demands-answers-from-sam-altman-after-new-reporting-reveals-how-ai-agents-went-rogue-to-conduct-major-cyber-breach-and-conceal-their-operations"}],"index":{"byteEnd":88,"byteStart":47}}],"langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreic6hsc65oufp5msaklnpgnkk2ggf25pagshjnusvacnmahjd4h4h4","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvar6zhhgs2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Senator Blumenthals letter is focused well imo www.blumenthal.senate.gov/newsroom/pre...\n\nIt’s about process and audibility and whether we’re using an appropriate standard of care or creating a race to the bottom."},"embed":{"external":{"uri":"https://www.blumenthal.senate.gov/newsroom/press/release/blumenthal-demands-answers-from-sam-altman-after-new-reporting-reveals-how-ai-agents-went-rogue-to-conduct-major-cyber-breach-and-conceal-their-operations","title":"Blumenthal Demands Answers from Sam Altman After New Reporting Reveals how AI agents Went Rogue to Conduct Major Cyber Breach & Conceal Their Operations | U.S. Senator Richard Blumenthal of Connecticu...","description":"[WASHINGTON, D.C.] — U.S. Senator Richard Blumenthal (D-CT) today demanded answers from OpenAI CEO Sam Altman after recent reporting from The New York...","thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreigh65z6yjyipgqgbof2iixudeqjrcpi7mnkrlroodnaeutwpwtlgu"},"$type":"app.bsky.embed.external#view"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:21:45.762Z","labels":[]},"replies":[],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"},{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarhrm4lc22","cid":"bafyreigsvxw33zrudnmsczja42tynxvggkshnjky3hqfti54ueturauu54","author":{"did":"did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g","handle":"yetanotheruseless.com","displayName":"jake","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/bafkreid2mupigj6y73b6fsmvfrqkaq6tnkhwpuuitcoh34miem3audxf6e","associated":{"chat":{"allowIncoming":"all","allowGroupInvites":"all"},"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-05-13T04:19:35.099Z"},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:25:33.802Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreic6hsc65oufp5msaklnpgnkk2ggf25pagshjnusvacnmahjd4h4h4","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvar6zhhgs2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Ok so I’m not against more time, that’s fine. And so yes we need to give examples of *not terribly unlikely* hugely negative events, to make it even possible to garner rational support for said slowdown.\n\n*Not* extinction, which is literally a distraction which triggers lizard brain responses."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":0,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:25:34.572Z","labels":[]},"replies":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarjphs6s2o","cid":"bafyreibuq222w4sq36yuhyedrb67jr2a5w6m5cdgswz5x42azfbmbac2dy","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:26:38.672Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreigsvxw33zrudnmsczja42tynxvggkshnjky3hqfti54ueturauu54","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarhrm4lc22"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"Ok that’s fine, we can talk about engineered pandemics which might only kill 90% or so. There we work on early warning signals, testing platforms, vaccine development, etc. Also useful for lesser disasters."},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":2,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:26:39.156Z","labels":[]},"replies":[{"post":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarmpz4lk2o","cid":"bafyreighu4wrzfod33xpt6r5yxymku2f3uigbs5uuk2yx5araycxtcfql4","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"record":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-09-11T14:28:19.903Z","embed":{"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record","record":{"cid":"bafyreig4zcya7656sz4h4odjzuowlkoufuvthxkhoit6naaueq26ka42ve","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mk42nr7sfs2e"}},"facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#link","uri":"https://bsky.app/profile/moskov.goodventures.org/post/3mk42nr7sfs2e"}],"index":{"byteEnd":104,"byteStart":80}}],"langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreibuq222w4sq36yuhyedrb67jr2a5w6m5cdgswz5x42azfbmbac2dy","uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvarjphs6s2o"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreidh5pjgnine2ggah3mv2wadmwtcurondjkl5jpbt7m2ice2clf22i","uri":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.post/3mvalidmqoc24"}},"text":"I largely agree with you on the comms I like this as a metaphor for shifting it bsky.app/profile/mosk...\n\nLets build strength in depth"},"embed":{"record":{"uri":"at://did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/app.bsky.feed.post/3mk42nr7sfs2e","cid":"bafyreig4zcya7656sz4h4odjzuowlkoufuvthxkhoit6naaueq26ka42ve","author":{"did":"did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r","handle":"moskov.goodventures.org","displayName":"Dustin Moskovitz","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:z7oad4td5k4tfb4dttzjym7r/bafkreiapds4x6n2sobfyijxfnel5dvcxbzycvrwa7trogzz62o5lkhc7y4","associated":{"activitySubscription":{"allowSubscriptions":"followers"}},"labels":[],"createdAt":"2023-04-10T16:53:51.956Z","verification":{"verifications":[{"issuer":"did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur","issuerDisplayName":"Bluesky","issuerHandle":"bsky.app","uri":"at://did:plc:z72i7hdynmk6r22z27h6tvur/app.bsky.graph.verification/3lvdc6hlzcy2l","isValid":true,"createdAt":"2025-08-01T09:03:42.030Z"}],"verifiedStatus":"valid","trustedVerifierStatus":"none"}},"value":{"$type":"app.bsky.feed.post","createdAt":"2026-04-22T17:49:31.804Z","langs":["en"],"reply":{"parent":{"cid":"bafyreiapw34p7lt2skplaaigwmw4c5pge223gthqwrhxrbhlmwjzl6qfma","uri":"at://did:plc:eazpcat6l4z7fcvewe2jeego/app.bsky.feed.post/3mk3zuo6ezk2p"},"root":{"cid":"bafyreihl23ow6w5nnolxn5y77olglcrhqwq6jqyo5djejtxbts2weg7ttu","uri":"at://did:plc:vszw3ess46odfhnzdsy4huae/app.bsky.feed.post/3meznlfvwjc2v"}},"text":"Yes, I think this is the precise crux. Functionally, I do not see the situation as a big old glass shield that a micrometeoroid can pierce if it plays out just so or if anyone has the means to try.\n\nRather, I see it like a dense network of protections of many kinds, being attacked all the time."},"labels":[],"likeCount":2,"replyCount":1,"repostCount":0,"quoteCount":2,"indexedAt":"2026-04-22T17:49:32.349Z","embeds":[],"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record#viewRecord"},"$type":"app.bsky.embed.record#view"},"bookmarkCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repostCount":0,"likeCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"indexedAt":"2026-09-11T14:28:20.457Z","labels":[]},"replies":[],"threadContext":{"rootAuthorLike":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.like/3mvarxzjupz2e"},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}],"threadContext":{"rootAuthorLike":"at://did:plc:bjaceaxgoto5p7gor2rcov3g/app.bsky.feed.like/3mvars5ux2j2j"},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}],"threadContext":{},"$type":"app.bsky.feed.defs#threadViewPost"}}